 Related issues linked using `fixes #number`\r\n- [ ] [e2e](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/contributing/core/testing.md#writing-tests-for-nextjs) tests added\r\n- [ ] Documentation added\r\n- [ ] Telemetry added. In case of a feature if it's used or not.\r\n- [ ] Errors have a helpful link attached, see [`contributing.md`](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/contributing.md)\r\n\r\n## Documentation / Examples\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make sure the linting passes by running `pnpm build && pnpm lint`\r\n- [ ] The \"examples guidelines\" are followed from [our contributing doc](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/contributing/examples/adding-examples.md)\r\n\nfix NEXT-447","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/45745/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":1,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/45745/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1461241507","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/46948#issuecomment-1461241507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/46948","id":1461241507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5XGMaj","user":{"login":"seiry","id":4397354,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTczNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4397354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry","html_url":"https://github.com/seiry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seiry/orgs","repos_url":"https://